### DM 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/dms
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### DM 시작 (없으면 생성, 있으면 기존 반환)
POST {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/dms
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "targetUserId": "{{targetUserId}}"
}

###

### DM 재시도 — 동일한 채널 반환 확인
POST {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/dms
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "targetUserId": "{{targetUserId}}"
}

###

### 자기 자신에게 DM — 400 예상
POST {{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/dms
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "targetUserId": "cmofh15kv0000msvf7k356lno"
}

###

### DM 채널에서 메시지 전송 (기존 message API 그대로 사용)
POST {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{dmChannelId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "content": { "type": "doc", "content": [{ "type": "paragraph", "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "안녕하세요 DM입니다!" }] }] }
}

###

### DM 채널 메시지 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{dmChannelId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

